<title>USA: Brookland-Cayce SD 2, S.C., won by Wachovia Bank.</title>
<headline>Brookland-Cayce SD 2, S.C., won by Wachovia Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Bank said it won $10 million of Brookland-Cayce SD 2, S.C., general obligation bonds, Sereis 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.85 percent.</p>
